        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自你安装以来，这些项目有更改或新增：%1$@。只有在你预期 %2$@ 会有更新时才批准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Things stay here for 30 days, then they're gone for good." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تبقى الأشياء هنا 30 يومًا، ثم تُحذف نهائيًا."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dinge bleiben 30 Tage hier, dann sind sie endgültig weg."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las cosas se quedan aquí 30 días y después desaparecen para siempre."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les éléments restent ici 30 jours, puis disparaissent définitivement."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le cose restano qui per 30 giorni, poi spariscono per sempre."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ここに入ったものは30日間保管され、その後は完全に削除されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "여기에 있는 항목은 30일 동안 보관된 후 완전히 삭제돼요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "As coisas ficam aqui por 30 dias e depois somem de vez."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "东西会在这里保留 30 天，之后就会永久删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Things you delete wait here for 30 days, in case you change your mind." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
